# O -- PAW setup (NDLSS augmentation) with published parameters
# Source: the production setup of P. E. Bloechl as given in
#   M. Sotoudeh et al., Phys. Rev. B 95, 235150 (2017).
# The !NTBO sub-block holds the onsite-hybrid parameters of that paper
#   (LHFWEIGHT etc.). It is used only when a local hybrid (PBE0r, SCAN0r)
#   is selected with !DFT!NTBO MODUS='HYBRID'; plain PBE ignores it.
# As for any setup, check convergence and ghost states (GHOSTBUSTER)
#   for the system at hand.
#
  !SPECIES NAME='O_' NPRO=1 1 1 LRHOX=4 RAD/RCOV=1.2
    !NTBO NOFL=1 1 0 CV=T LHFWEIGHT=0.05
          TAILLAMBDA=4. 2. RAUG/RCOV=0.6
          RTAIL/RCOV=0.8 RTAILCUT/RCOV=2. !END
    !AUGMENT ID='O_NDLSS_PBE0R_PRB2017' EL='O' ZV=6. TYPE='NDLSS'
             RBOX/RCOV=1.2 RCSM/RCOV=0.25
             RCL/RCOV=0.7 0.7 0.7 0.7
      !GRID DMIN=1.E-6 DMAX=0.1 RMAX=10. !END
      !POT  POW=3. RC/RCOV=0.7 !END
      !CORE POW=2. RC/RCOV=0.7 !END
    !END
  !END
